# Faultline environment reference. Copy what you need; never commit real values.
#
# There is nothing to set for local development of the standalone demo.

# --- Standalone (Vercel) build ------------------------------------------------
# Verified URL of the live DeepSpace deployment. Leave unset until that
# deployment has been opened and checked: while unset, the standalone build
# hides every "full app" and "Sign in" link instead of pointing at a dead URL.
VITE_CANONICAL_URL=

# --- DeepSpace worker secrets (set with the DeepSpace CLI, not in a file) -----
# Bindings such as DEEPSPACE_APP_ID, OWNER_USER_ID, AUTH_* and the Durable
# Object namespaces are provisioned by `npx deepspace deploy`; do not set them
# by hand.
#
# Opt-in for owner-billed external integrations (AI summaries, GitHub commit
# lookup, web search). Anything other than the exact value "enabled" keeps
# them off. When on, they still require the collaborator role and are
# rate-limited per user per day.
# FAULTLINE_INTEGRATIONS=enabled
#
# Development-only debug routes. Never enable in production.
# ALLOW_DEBUG_ROUTES=
